original_text: ["({T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.)\\nAs Murmuring Bosk enters the battlefield, you may reveal a Treefolk card from your hand. If you don't, Murmuring Bosk enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B} to your mana pool. Murmuring Bosk deals 1 damage to you.", "Boseiju, Who Shelters All enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Pay 2 life: Add {1} to your mana pool. If that mana is spent on an instant or sorcery spell, that spell can't be countered by spells or abilities.", "Cumulative upkeep—\\nPay 2 life.\\nWhen Glacial Chasm enters the battlefield, sacrifice a land.\\nCreatures you control can't attack.\\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to you.", 'Each land is a Swamp in addition to its other land types.', 'G', 'Hideaway (This land enters the battlefield tapped. When it does, look at the top four cards of your library, exile one face down, then put the rest on the bottom of your library.)\\n{T}: Add {W} to your mana pool.\\n{W}, {T}: You may play the exiled card without paying its mana cost if you attacked with three or more creatures this turn.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.\\nWhenever you tap Forbidden Orchard for mana, put a 1/1 colorless Spirit creature token onto the battlefield under target opponent's control.", '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{2}{R}, {T}: Shivan Gorge deals 1 damage to each opponent.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G} to your mana pool. Each opponent gains 1 life.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{T}: Desert deals 1 damage to target attacking creature. Activate this ability only during the end of combat step.', '{T}: Add {2} to your mana pool. Ancient Tomb deals 2 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {U} to your mana pool. Cephalid Coliseum deals 1 damage to you.\\nThreshold — {U}, {T}, Sacrifice Cephalid Coliseum: Target player draws three cards, then discards three cards. Activate this ability only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.', '{T}: Untap target attacking creature. Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by that creature this turn.']
original_type: ['Land', 'Land Creature — Forest Dryad', 'Land — Desert', 'Land — Forest', 'Legendary Land']
